  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Infrastructure and Technical Assistance Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment focuses on Australia&apos;s support in (i) infrastructure (ii) capacity building and (iii) enhancing border security. As part of capacity building, Australia is currently supporting the Kiribati government with technical advice under the Australia Pacific Partnerships Platform Program (AusP3) to critical sectors including Finance, Engineering and Utilities.</narrative>
  </description>
